  "description": {
    "text": "A box of August 2008 with a Diamond & Pearl series theme deck, two booster packs, a holofoil Palkia DP27 and a jumbo copy of it in either mirror or cracked ice holofoil; the Dialga Premium Box held Dialga DP26 the same way. According to the product sheet PokéBeach quoted, a case held seven Dialga boxes and five Palkia boxes. Palkia reprints the Palkia of the Diamond & Pearl and Great Encounters sets with Daisuke Ito's different art, which first came in Japan as Palkia 039/DP-P, one of twelve cards in Meiji's July 2007 series of Pokémon chocolate promos.",
